      "name": "BenjaminTodd",
      "username": "BenjaminTodd",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ecc23a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-08T07:54:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi All,<br>Some help with a combo I hadn't had before. &nbsp;<br><br>Ambuscade's traps start with:</p><blockquote><p>Whenever this card is face-up on the top of the villain deck...</p></blockquote><p>Visonary's Precognition card reads:</p><blockquote><p>Reveal the top 3 cards of the villain deck.<br>Put 1 on top of the villian deck and 2 on the bottom of the villian deck</p></blockquote><p>Three questions:<br>1. Does the trap detonate when it's revealed?&nbsp; I seems like it would given the text.<br>2. Is it considered one of the three cards for Precognition? &nbsp;<br>3. If so (and didn't detonate), can it be moved?<br><br>Thanks,<br>Ben</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:40.985Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
