      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-08T14:43:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If Visionary is incapacitated by the trap the revealed cards should go back to the deck in the order they came off the top.</p><p>I would say it works this way because the action fails at the reveal stage, which would make it similar to RC Wraith trying to play a revealed environment card when Foam Grenades is active, which in the app returns the revealed card to the top of the environment deck.</p>",
